      ":question/problem": "Which of the following are square matrices?\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$J =\\begin{bmatrix}1.5 & -3 & 0.1 & -\\sqrt{2} & -10 \\\\ 4 & -6 & -6 & 0.5 & 0 \\\\ -5 & -2 & 10 & 0.2 & 9 \\\\ 8 & -9 & -7 & \\sqrt{2} & 8 \\\\ -9 & 3 & \\sqrt{3} & -1 & -\\sqrt{2}\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$N =\\begin{bmatrix}-8 & 0.5 \\\\ 1 & 0.5 \\\\ 5 & -6\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$Z =\\begin{bmatrix}-7 & -7 \\\\ -6 & 0.2 \\\\ -5 & -9 \\\\ -2 & 0 \\\\ -3 & 9\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>",
      ":question/worked-solution": "- $J$ is a square matrix.\n\n- $N$ is not a square matrix.\n\n- $Z$ is not a square matrix.\n\nTherefore, $J$ satisfies the definition.",
