      ":question/problem": "Which of the following are square matrices?\n\nSelect all that apply.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "- $D$ is *not* a square matrix since the numbers of rows and columns are not the same. It has $2$ rows and $5$ columns, so it's a $2\\times 5$ matrix.\n\n- $X$ is a square matrix since it has the same number of rows and columns. It has $2$ rows and $2$ columns, so it is a $2\\times 2$ matrix.\n\n- $Z$ is *not* a square matrix since the numbers of rows and columns are not the same. It has $2$ rows and $1$ column, so it's a $2\\times 1$ matrix.\n\nTherefore, only $X$ is a square matrix.",
